      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514646::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC7514646::web::006::3_1_interface_of_hea_diamond_composite"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The graded transition prevents W–Cu phase separation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under irradiation, the Ni layer acts as a barrier to excessive diffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Ni layer maintains coherent W/Cu interfaces under irradiation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Ni interlayer facilitates phonon transport across the W/Cu interface.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ni-coated W–Cu composites will contain fewer interfacial voids than untreated W–Cu composites.",
